    "synopsis": {
        "native": "La 92 de ani, Nora Iuga este un personaj unic: poet\u0103, romancier\u0103 \u0219i traduc\u0103toare, suflet t\u00e2n\u0103r \u0219i avangardist, cu spirit ludic, carism\u0103 \u0219i autoironie. Povestea scriitoarei ale c\u0103rei c\u0103r\u0163i au fost interzise de comuni\u015fti pentru \"erotism morbid\", povestea unei femei care tr\u0103ie\u0219te poezia. Un documentar-portret care ne invit\u0103 s\u0103 descoperim natura acestui erotism, felul \u00een care \u00eenc\u0103 \u00eei influen\u0163eaz\u0103 Norei scrisul \u015fi perspectiva asupra vie\u0163ii\u2026 dar \u015fi s\u0103 afl\u0103m secretul tinere\u0163ii f\u0103r\u0103 b\u0103tr\u00e2ne\u0163e!",
        "english": "Poet, novelist and translator, 92-year-old Nora Iuga is a unique character on the contemporary literature scene. Discover the Romanian writer banned by communists for \"morbid eroticism\" and learn her secret of always staying young."
    },
